# A dataset written by cc-data 0.2.x: its manifest records each file's size, so it must
# check out byte for byte on every platform.
internal/dataset/testdata/v0.2/** -text
# The guidance is embedded byte for byte, and its tests bound its size and match text that
# wraps across lines, so it checks out with LF on every platform.
internal/guidance/src/*.md text eol=lf
